<h2 class="mt-14">Consent and purchaser suppression for Customer acquisition</h2>
<p>For customer acquisition, audit consent capture and purchase-event suppression before the first flow goes live — every app must record customer acquisition opt-ins you can evidence and halt promos at checkout. Protect the customer acquisition channel first: post-purchase, refund-window, and support-case promos do more damage than dull customer acquisition copy.</p>
