<thead><tr><th>Audience state</th><th>Required handling</th><th>Why it matters</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>No documented consent</td><td>No customer acquisition promos without proof; transactional messages only</td><td>Consent evidence underwrites all customer acquisition sending</td></tr>
<tr><td>Consented, never purchased</td><td>Lead customer acquisition newcomers with teaching and social proof</td><td>First-touch customer acquisition codes create discount dependence</td></tr>
<tr><td>Active cart, no checkout</td><td>Context-rich customer acquisition nudge before any incentive</td><td>Protects customer acquisition profit when purchase intent is hottest</td></tr>
<tr><td>Purchased recently</td><td>Customer Acquisition buyers get education, not another pitch</td><td>Spares customer acquisition buyers remorse and unsubscribes</td></tr>
<tr><td>Refund or return open</td><td>Freeze customer acquisition promos until refund or return closes</td><td>Customer Acquisition tolerance collapses mid-dispute</td></tr>
<tr><td>Repeated non-engagement</td><td>Remove chronic customer acquisition non-openers pre-complaint</td><td>Customer Acquisition deliverability depends on pruning</td></tr>
<tr><td>SMS consent present</td><td>Customer Acquisition texting respects time and frequency rules</td><td>One customer acquisition SMS complaint outweighs many email ones</td></tr>
<tr><td>Wholesale or B2B account</td><td>Isolate customer acquisition wholesale comms from retail blasts</td><td>Wholesale customer acquisition terms forbid retail-style offers</td></tr>
<tr><td>Free or disposable email domain</td><td>Verify customer acquisition throwaway addresses pre-journey</td><td>Customer Acquisition bounces from junk signups hurt inboxing</td></tr>
<tr><td>Staff and test accounts</td><td>Customer Acquisition internal accounts never enter production</td><td>Internal customer acquisition activity corrupts program metrics</td></tr>
<tr><td>Competitor or researcher signals</td><td>No bespoke customer acquisition track for competitor signals</td><td>Customer Acquisition consistency beats clever carve-outs</td></tr>
<tr><td>Legacy list without timestamps</td><td>Legacy customer acquisition contacts re-opt before journeys</td><td>Timestamp-less customer acquisition consent is legal exposure</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
<h2 class="mt-12">Margin, app costs, and pricing for Customer acquisition</h2>
<p>Attributed revenue is not profit for customer acquisition. A self-funding customer acquisition program survives a full cost model: subscription, contact or send overages, SMS credits, capture tooling, templates, agency time, and every point of customer acquisition discount margin. When the customer acquisition stack nears fifteen percent of email-attributed margin, simplify the customer acquisition setup before tuning it.</p>
<p>Pricing changes frequently and varies by region, contact volume, and contract term, so check the official pricing pages of every shortlisted app and model an eighteen-month total that includes a peak season. Before banking on free for customer acquisition, check which free-tier limit — contacts, sends, branching, support — hits your customer acquisition plan earliest.</p>
